              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon. May have a shield (+2 pts), axe (+2) or thrusting spear (+2) and light armour (+2). May ride in a four-horse heavy chariot or two-horse light chariot bought from the Chariotry list (not enforced). Rightful Conduct (Spring and Autumn period only). (The Art of War p.29)</characteristic>
