              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Two crewmen with hand weapons - one armed with a dagger axe or thrusting spear and one armed with a bow riding in a four-horse heavy chariot with unarmed driver. The chariot is armoured with an animal skin carapace which acts as a shield. Crew may have light armour (+2 pts each). Chariots. (The Art of War p.30)</characteristic>
