              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon, thrusting spear, shield and light armour. May have large shield (+1 pt). May make spear long handled (+2 pts). Long Handled Weapons. Combined Formation. (The Art of War p.30)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
